# Bloodmoon "Rebellion at Frostmoth": Captain Falx Carius finds his garrison
# edgy. A guard bribed with sujamma blames the dry fort and names the priest
# Antonius Nuncius; his desk in the Armory holds the missing liquor, and once
# confronted the player reports him to Carius.
# AddItem stands in for buying the sujamma; the unlock stands in for picking
# the desk's lock. Ref FormIDs carry Bloodmoon.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from bm_morale
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case bm_morale
run
player->AddItem potion_local_liquor_01 1
player->PositionCell 4095 3800 15124 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Carius' Chambers"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, Carius' Chambers" == 1
talk falx carius
ask Fort Frostmoth
ask edgy
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 10
ask disturbing trends
ask morale has been low
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 20
bye
run
player->Position -173771 143037 908 0
until 600 "vilbia herennia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk vilbia herennia
ask booze
choose 9
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 30
ask dry fort
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 40
bye
run
player->PositionCell 4095 3800 15124 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Carius' Chambers"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, Carius' Chambers" == 1
talk falx carius
ask morale has been low
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 50
bye
run
player->Position -173771 143037 908 0
until 600 "vilbia herennia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk vilbia herennia
ask booze
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 55
ask Antonius Nuncius
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 60
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3755 3400 15889 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine" == 1
talk antonius nuncius
ask dry fort
choose 1
ask shipments stopped arriving
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 70
bye
run
player->PositionCell 63 485 439 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Armory"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, Armory" == 1
console 069F253C.unlock
activate 069F253C
close ContainerMenu
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 80
run
player->PositionCell 3755 3400 15889 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine" == 1
talk antonius nuncius
ask shipments stopped arriving
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 90
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 95
bye
run
player->PositionCell 4095 3800 15124 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Carius' Chambers"
until 600 GetPCCell "Fort Frostmoth, Carius' Chambers" == 1
talk falx carius
ask morale has been low
expect GetJournalIndex BM_Morale == 100
bye
end
